&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BAYADA offers a comprehensive benefits plan that includes the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid holidays, vacation and sick leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vision, dental and medical health plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employer paid life insurance, 401k with company match, direct deposit and employee assistance program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Field mileage reimbursement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a HHMC Nurse Manager your day may look like this!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
