&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is your calling for 1:1 Care!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Tucson Skilled Office is interested in a Licensed Practical Nurse (LPN) who has a passion for geriatric or pediatric care to join our Skilled Nursing team. We believe our clients and their families deserve the highest quality care delivered with compassion, excellence, and reliability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Clients:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We currently have overnight shifts caring for clients in the Tucson area.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation and Schedule:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Schedules can vary per client and consist of 4, 8, 10 or 12 hour shifts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Starting pay $31 per hour&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;All BAYADA Skilled Nurses Enjoy:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly paychecks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible schedules that work for you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One-on-one client care&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preventive care covered for ALL employees (PRN included)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scholarship opportunities, free courses, and on-the-job training&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;$1,200 nurse referral bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Choose our Tucson BAYADA Office?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supportive, team-focused culture – Our Tucson Office is a close-knit team and known for its hands-on support, open communication, and strong sense of community where nurses feel valued and never alone in the field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible schedules with meaningful impact – We offer the autonomy to create a schedule that works for you while providing one-on-one care that makes a lasting difference in the lives of our clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You take care of others, BAYADA takes care of you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;Benefits for full-time employees include:&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, dental, vision, prescription coverage&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PTO (paid vacation or sick leave)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid holidays, vacation, and sick leave* &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) with company match*&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employer-paid life insurance* &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scholarship opportunities, free courses, and on-the-job training&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What makes private duty nursing different than home health visits?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Traditional shifts (4’s, 8’s, 10’s or 12’s)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on care with only one client per day&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building client relationships and watching their milestones&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What your day looks like at BAYADA:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to &lt;strong&gt;one&lt;/strong&gt; client’s home near you on a schedule you choose&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow up with, execute, and properly document doctors&#39; orders &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform assessments and monitor clients&#39; conditions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document observations, interventions, and evaluations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feel empowered to perform skills with autonomy in the home&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re honored to be recognized as:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newsweek&#39;s Greatest Workplace for: Overall, Women, Parents &amp;amp; Families, Diversity &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forbes Best Employers for Veterans&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 14, 14);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications for a private duty LPN:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Graduation from an accredited and approved nursing program, as indicated by school transcript or diploma &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A current nursing license in good standing in the state&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One year of experience working as a Licensed Practical Nurse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trach care experience preferred, but not required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
